      <title>撞名Anthropic的“外挂”刷屏：宣称碾压却无人复现，Token开销翻倍</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260821/%E6%92%9E%E5%90%8DAnthropic%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%96%E6%8C%82%E5%88%B7%E5%B1%8F%E5%AE%A3%E7%A7%B0%E7%A2%BE%E5%8E%8B%E5%8D%B4%E6%97%A0%E4%BA%BA%E5%A4%8D%E7%8E%B0Token%E5%BC%80%E9%94%80%E7%BF%BB%E5%80%8D/</link>
